# Types: keyword        plain question that shares vocabulary with the answer
#        paraphrase     no shared vocabulary with the passage that answers it
#        identifier     hinges on an exact error code, config key or CLI flag
#        multi-doc      needs more than one document or section
#        distractor     an outdated or look-alike page says something different
#        access         the best source is above the asker's level (relevant = what they MAY see)
#        unanswerable   nothing in the corpus answers it
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
